## Enroll and add outcome to Smile Train program

tags: smiletrain

* Login to Bahmni as a "nurse"
* Receptionist creates the "cure" patient and starts an IPD
* Open "Programs" module
* Goto All sections and search the newly created patient
* Search and select patient
* Select patient into "Smile Train" program
* Enroll patient into Smile Train program with "123", "Dr. Smith", "Dr. Brown", "Registered", "Lip Tie", "Speech Assessment"
* Navigate to Program page
*Navigate to Smile Train
* Validate Smile Train queue row for "123", "Lip Tie", "Speech Assessment", "Dr. Smith", "Registered"
*Navigate to program of selected patient
*Add Program outcome "Approved"
* Navigate to Program page
*Navigate to Smile Train
*Validate Program outcome "Approved" 

